* Sun Nov 08 2026 Sebastian J. Wolf <sebastian@ygriega.de> 0.5.0-1
- Restart of Zaster Banker as a personal finance app, built on AqBanking
- Bank selection with search as you type, setup of a FinTS PIN/TAN access
- photoTAN and text TAN, choice of the TAN method
- Accounts and their balances, with a total per bank and per currency; the
  cover shows the banks with their totals
- The last known balances show at start, each with its date
- Balances can be refreshed for all bank accesses or for one, from the
  context menu of its name, which also removes a bank access
- Transactions of the last 90 days, opened by tapping an account; a
  transaction can be copied to the clipboard
- Holdings of a depot, with their value and a total per currency
- An accepted PIN is remembered in memory for 5 minutes per bank access
- Everything stored is encrypted, the key is kept in Sailfish Secrets
